X:1
T:Come Thou Fount Of Every Blessing
T:NETTLETON
C:Music: Asahel Nettleton, 1812 · Words: Robert Robinson, 1758
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: The Evangelical Hymnal, 1921, Hymn 256. Almost the same as The Presbyterian Hymnal, 1874 Hymn 94.. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/nettleton): 100% of pitches and 100% of note lengths agree.
